  "bodyText": "Welcome to First Baptist Church Muncie\n\n“Praise & Proclaim” - Isaiah 12:4\n\nWorship With Us\n\nSUNDAYS AT 10:45 AM OR VIEW ONLINE ANYTIME\n\nWhere to find us\n309 East Adams Street, Muncie, IN 47305\n\nUpcoming Events\n\nFor full events see our calendar. On mobile, select \"list\" view option on drop down menu which is set to \"month\" by default.\n\nChurch Blog\n\nHändel's Messiah Sing-In & Carols in Muncie - December 11th, 2026\n\nUpcoming Events at FBC Muncie | Lent & Easter 2026\n\nEcclesiastes - faith when everything is not enough\n\nRead the latest from FBCM\n\nWhat to expect\n\nBefore you visit us, click the button below to learn more about what happens at FBCM every Sunday!\n\nJoin us for worship\n\nWorship is at 10:45 AM each Sunday.\nFor live streams, please visit our YouTube channel.\n\n[Button] Who We Are -> https://www.fbcmuncie.org/who-we-are\n\n[Button] What To Expect -> https://www.fbcmuncie.org/what-to-expect\n\n[Button] Services & Sermons -> https://www.youtube.com/@FbcmuncieOrg/streams\n\n[Button] All Posts -> https://www.fbcmuncie.org/blog\n\n[Button] Learn More -> https://www.fbcmuncie.org/what-to-expect",
